Package: BGNLMforSINDy
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Generalized Nonlinear Models for Basis-Free SINDy with Model Uncertainty
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Aliaksandr", "Hubin", email = "aliaksandr.hubin@nmbu.no", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jon", "Lachmann", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Reproducible experimental benchmark pipeline for ICML expanding
    "Bayesian Generalized Nonlinear Models Offer Basis Free SINDy With Model Uncertainty".
    Evaluates basis-free BGNLM (GMJMCMC) against predefined-basis BGLM (MJMCMC),
    classical and Bayesian/Ensemble SINDy, SINDy-PI, and Symbolic Regression (PySR, PyOperon)
    across 12 synthetic ODE systems and 5 real-world empirical datasets with mixed-effects
    statistical evaluation.
